{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000163581","approvedSymbol":"SLC2A2","functionDescriptions":["Facilitative hexose transporter that mediates the transport of glucose, fructose and galactose (PubMed:16186102, PubMed:23396969, PubMed:28083649, PubMed:8027028, PubMed:8457197). Likely mediates the bidirectional transfer of glucose across the plasma membrane of hepatocytes and is responsible for uptake of glucose by the beta cells; may comprise part of the glucose-sensing mechanism of beta cells (PubMed:8027028). May also participate with the Na(+)/glucose cotransporter in the transcellular transport of glucose in the small intestine and kidney (PubMed:3399500). Also able to mediate the transport of dehydroascorbate and urate (PubMed:23396969, PubMed:40209957). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:16186102, ECO:0000269|PubMed:23396969, ECO:0000269|PubMed:28083649, ECO:0000269|PubMed:3399500, ECO:0000269|PubMed:40209957, ECO:0000269|PubMed:8027028, ECO:0000269|PubMed:8457197}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"P11168","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A0C4DH64","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"C9J0E8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8WBJ2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000323568","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000417918","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000418456","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000418888","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548455","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548456","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548457","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548458","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548459","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548460","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000548461","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646185","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646186","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646187","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646191","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646194","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646195","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000646196","s